#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/compress.rst:4
msgid "Compress and Decompress the KV cache"
msgstr "压缩和解压缩 KV 缓存"

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/compress.rst:6
msgid "The ``compress`` interface is defined as the following:"
msgstr "``compress`` 接口定义如下："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/compress.rst:13
msgid ""
"These 2 functions compresses/decompresses the KV cache chunks specified "
"by ``tokens`` using the given ``method`` in the storage ``location``. The"
" controller returns an ``event_id`` and the number of tokens scheduled "
"for compression or decompression."
msgstr "这两个函数使用给定的 ``method`` 在存储 ``location`` 中压缩/解压缩由 ``tokens`` 指定的 KV 缓存块。控制器返回一个 ``event_id`` 和计划压缩或解压缩的 token 数量。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/compress.rst:17
msgid "Example usage:"
msgstr "使用示例："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/compress.rst:19
msgid ""
"First, we need a yaml file ``example.yaml`` to properly configure the "
"lmcache instance:"
msgstr "首先，我们需要一个 yaml 文件 ``example.yaml`` 来正确配置 lmcache 实例："

#: ../../source/kv_cache_management/compress.rst:37
msgid "Second, we need to start the vllm/lmcache instance at port 8000:"
msgstr "其次，我们需要在端口 8000 启动 vllm/lmcache 实例："

